     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ContentReviewer.html\">Content Reviewer / Approver</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"APPROVE-01\"> </a></b>Review L2 DAK for completeness</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review all 9 DAK components for completeness, accuracy against L1 recommendations, and cross-component consistency.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"APPROVE-02\"> </a></b>Approve L2 content for L3 authoring</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can formally approve L2 DAK content as ready for L3 FHIR authoring to begin.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"APPROVE-03\"> </a></b>Review draft publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review a draft IG publication (status=draft, releaseLabel=draft) and provide structured feedback.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"APPROVE-04\"> </a></b>Approve for release publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can provide final sign-off for release publication after all review issues have been addressed.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"APPROVE-05\"> </a></b>Assess change impact</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether content changes are breaking (non-compatible), compatible-substantive, or non-substantive for versioning decisions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"APPROVE-06\"> </a></b>Enforce governance policies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify content aligns with WHO guidelines governance policies and cross-programme harmonization requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ContentReviewer.html\">Content Reviewer / Approver</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-APPROVE-01\"> </a></b>Review L2 DAK for completeness</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review all 9 DAK components for completeness, accuracy against L1 recommendations, and cross-component consistency.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-APPROVE-02\"> </a></b>Approve L2 content for L3 authoring</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can formally approve L2 DAK content as ready for L3 FHIR authoring to begin.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-APPROVE-03\"> </a></b>Review draft publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review a draft IG publication (status=draft, releaseLabel=draft) and provide structured feedback.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-APPROVE-04\"> </a></b>Approve for release publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can provide final sign-off for release publication after all review issues have been addressed.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-APPROVE-05\"> </a></b>Assess change impact</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether content changes are breaking (non-compatible), compatible-substantive, or non-substantive for versioning decisions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-APPROVE-06\"> </a></b>Enforce governance policies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify content aligns with WHO guidelines governance policies and cross-programme harmonization requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ContentReviewer.html\">Content Reviewer / Approver</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-APPROVE-01\"> </a></b>Review L2 DAK for completeness</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review all 9 DAK components for completeness, accuracy against L1 recommendations, and cross-component consistency.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-APPROVE-02\"> </a></b>Approve L2 content for L3 authoring</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can formally approve L2 DAK content as ready for L3 FHIR authoring to begin.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-APPROVE-03\"> </a></b>Review draft publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review a draft IG publication (status=draft, releaseLabel=draft) and provide structured feedback.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-APPROVE-04\"> </a></b>Approve for release publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can provide final sign-off for release publication after all review issues have been addressed.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-APPROVE-05\"> </a></b>Assess change impact</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether content changes are breaking (non-compatible), compatible-substantive, or non-substantive for versioning decisions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-APPROVE-06\"> </a></b>Enforce governance policies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify content aligns with WHO guidelines governance policies and cross-programme harmonization requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\"><hr/><p><b>Chinese</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent</b></p><a name=\"zh-SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><a name=\"zh-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ContentReviewer.html\">Content Reviewer / Approver</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-APPROVE-01\"> </a></b>Review L2 DAK for completeness</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review all 9 DAK components for completeness, accuracy against L1 recommendations, and cross-component consistency.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-APPROVE-02\"> </a></b>Approve L2 content for L3 authoring</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can formally approve L2 DAK content as ready for L3 FHIR authoring to begin.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-APPROVE-03\"> </a></b>Review draft publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review a draft IG publication (status=draft, releaseLabel=draft) and provide structured feedback.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-APPROVE-04\"> </a></b>Approve for release publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can provide final sign-off for release publication after all review issues have been addressed.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-APPROVE-05\"> </a></b>Assess change impact</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether content changes are breaking (non-compatible), compatible-substantive, or non-substantive for versioning decisions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-APPROVE-06\"> </a></b>Enforce governance policies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify content aligns with WHO guidelines governance policies and cross-programme harmonization requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\"><hr/><p><b>Russian</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Сгенери