p>Can provide final sign-off for release publication after all review issues have been addressed.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ru-APPROVE-05\"> </a></b>Assess change impact</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether content changes are breaking (non-compatible), compatible-substantive, or non-substantive for versioning decisions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ru-APPROVE-06\"> </a></b>Enforce governance policies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify content aligns with WHO guidelines governance policies and cross-programme harmonization requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><hr/><p><b>Spanish</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent</b></p><a name=\"es-SGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><a name=\"es-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ReviewAndApproveContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ContentReviewer.html\">Content Reviewer / Approver</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"es-APPROVE-01\"> </a></b>Review L2 DAK for completeness</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review all 9 DAK components for completeness, accuracy against L1 recommendations, and cross-component consistency.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"es-APPROVE-02\"> </a></b>Approve L2 content for L3 authoring</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can formally approve L2 DAK content as ready for L3 FHIR authoring to begin.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"es-APPROVE-03\"> </a></b>Review draft publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can review a draft IG publication (status=draft, releaseLabel=draft) and provide structured feedback.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"es-APPROVE-04\"> </a></b>Approve for release publication</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can provide final sign-off for release publication after all review issues have been addressed.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"es-APPROVE-05\"> </a></b>Assess change impact</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether content changes are breaking (non-compatible), compatible-substantive, or non-substantive for versioning decisions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"es-APPROVE-06\"> </a></b>Enforce governance policies</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify content aligns with WHO guidelines governance policies and cross-programme harmonization requirements.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div></div>"
